# The evaluator's tokens and box paths (eval/run_round_cron.sh).
.env.eval
*.safetensors
*.npy
*.png

# The reference latents ARE committed. They are the oracle -- four 256 kB tensors produced by the
# reference implementation at the pinned revisions -- and a benchmark whose oracle lives on one
# box is not reproducible by anyone. The negation must come AFTER `*.npy`; gitignore is ordered,
# and a negation placed before the pattern it negates does nothing.
!eval/cells/*/reference-latents*/*.npy
